      "message": "web: show each model's measured speed\n\nEvery model card gets a line with what metalfit measured from real replies on\nthis Mac - writing, writing at long context, reading prompts, and from how many\nreplies - or says it fills in by itself. The bar shows the loaded model's\nwriting speed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
