      },
      "message": "serve, menubar: deleted models leave the list\n\nThe folder signature returned one empty tuple whenever a single .gguf could not\nbe stat()ed. A symlink into the Hugging Face cache whose blob was deleted did\nthat, and from then on nothing that happened in the folder was noticed: a model\nmoved out of ~/models stayed in the list (checked on the running server). Now an\nunreadable file is left out of the signature instead; tests/test_folder.py.\n\nThe menu bar item rebuilds an open menu on every poll, so it never shows a\nstale list, and gains \"Open models folder\" (the status now says which folder)\nand \"Open at login\" through SMAppService.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
