      },
      "message": "menubar: its own mark, which shows the state\n\nA chip filled by a stack of layers - the model fits whole. In the menu bar the\nfill is the state: every layer loaded, half while loading, empty with nothing\nloaded, a dashed outline with the server off. Drawn in code (Icon.swift) as a\ntemplate image; makeicon.swift draws the same mark in colour for the app icon,\nand build.sh turns it into AppIcon.icns. Several Swift files allow no top-level\ncode, so both programs start from @main and build with -parse-as-library.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
