        "date": "2026-10-07T09:33:19Z"
      },
      "message": "menubar: MetalfitBar, the loaded model in the menu bar\n\nA Swift/AppKit menu bar item that polls /api/status every 2 s and shows the\nloaded model; its menu switches models, unloads, and starts or stops the server.\nStopping sends SIGTERM to the port's listener, which metalfit answers by\nunloading, so no llama-server stays wired. build.sh writes the server command\ninto Info.plist and warns about paths in folders macOS protects: from there the\nserver hung in its first open() until access was granted.\n\nREADME: the menu bar app, the two KV fixes, and Qwen3.6-35B-A3B measured on a\n32 GB M1 Max at five quantizations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
