        "name": "Admin",
        "email": "admin@Admins-MacBook-Pro-5.local",
        "date": "2026-10-07T09:33:19Z"
      },
      "message": "fit: KV cache of qwen35/qwen35moe and of per-layer KV heads\n\nqwen35 and qwen35moe (Qwen3.5 / 3.6) mark their attention layers only with\nfull_attention_interval: layer i is recurrent unless (i + 1) % interval == 0,\nand the nextn (MTP) layers have attention, as llama.cpp's models/qwen35moe.cpp\nsets them. Counted as every layer, Qwen3.8-27B needed 17.27 GiB of KV at 128K\ninstead of 4.66 and \"did not fit\".\n\ngemma4 gives attention.head_count_kv per layer (8 sliding, 2 full) and its own\nkey/value length for the sliding layers; the list read as one number was 0 heads\nand 0.00 GiB of KV. It is now split by the sliding-window pattern: 1.43 GiB at 128K.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
