        "date": "2026-10-06T14:23:37Z"
      },
      "message": "proxy: notice models appearing and disappearing while running\n\nThe model list was read once at startup and cached forever, which is\nwrong in a tool whose job is managing models: after three models were\ndeleted and one added on disk, /v1/models still offered the three gone\nones and never showed the new one, so a chat app listed models that\ncould not be loaded.\n\nIt now compares a cheap signature of the folder - every .gguf with its\nsize and mtime - and rescans when that changed.  Reading the GGUF\nheaders still only happens when something actually moved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
